    {
      "type": "post",
      "id": "7461073352993153024",
      "entityId": "7461073352993153024",
      "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sarahbarneshumphrey_supplychain-logistics-ai-activity-7461073352993153024-YLPP",
      "shareLinkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:ugcPost:7461073351797665792",
      "shareUrn": "urn:li:ugcPost:7461073351797665792",
      "content": "I keep hearing the same thing from supply chain leaders:\n“We have the data … but we still can’t move fast enough.”\n\nVisibility isn’t the problem anymore. Decision-making is.\n\nThat’s why I’m excited for this conversation with Irina Rosca and Michael Falls on June 10 at 1 p.m. ET \n\nWe’re digging into how AI is helping teams stop reacting to shipping problems and start making smarter financial decisions (before margins take a hit).\n\nWe’re talking:\n👉🏻 Why visibility alone is no longer enough\n👉🏻 The hidden shipping costs companies still miss\n👉🏻 How AI is replacing manual analysis and spreadsheet chaos\n👉🏻 Real lessons from Veracyte\n\nIf your team is still spending hours chasing shipping data after the fact … this one’s for you.\n\nClick “Attend” and join us LIVE!\n\n#SupplyChain #Logistics #AI #LinkedInLive #letstalksupplychain #Reveel #Reveel10June #2026June10 #LinkedinLive",
