      "entityId": "7468396710642339841",
      "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sarahbarneshumphrey_excited-to-be-moderating-a-webinar-on-june-activity-7468396710642339841-n1sv",
      "shareLinkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:share:7468396709463859200",
      "shareUrn": "urn:li:share:7468396709463859200",
      "content": "Excited to be moderating a webinar on June 9 with Gulf Winds International and BlackBerry!\n\nIf you're managing equipment at scale, you know how messy device connectivity and deployment can get ...\n\nGulf Winds ran into that exact problem - and solved it with BlackBerry Radar's dynamic pairing solution.\n\nIt's a good one. And you can hear it straight from the people who built it.\n\nBecause I'll be talking with Alysse C. Ligon, Director of Innovation at Gulf Winds, and Jason Anderson, Strategic Initiatives Director at BlackBerry Radar.\n\nRegister here: https://lnkd.in/e3fkJzn2\n\n(if you can't make it, we'll send you the recording after)\n\nFeel free to drop any questions you want me to ask Alysse and Jason 👇🏻",
